  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 12
  storyText: "We sat down today and tried to analyze everything. How many days has
    it been? Feels like weeks. Feels like years. Feels like time stopped and we're
    just\u2026 waiting. We counted our supplies again. Instant noodles: low. Water:
    lower. Medicine: almost gone. Hope: undefined. We talked about escape plans.
    Down the stairs? Too many zombies. Across the rooftop? Too far. Wait for rescue?
    That's the current plan. It's not a good plan. We analyzed the zombies too. They're
    slower in the rain. Faster at night. Hungry all the time. We still don't know
    what started this. We don't know how it spreads. We don't know anything. But
    we sat down and analyzed anyway. Made us feel smart for about five minutes. Then
    reality came back."
